                    👁️ Preview Student Portal
                  </button>
                  <button onclick="downloadSelf()" style="padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b; color: #0f172a; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; border: none; cursor: pointer;">
