                  <div style="font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6ee7b7; font-weight: bold;">Hours</div>
                </div>
                <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85); padding: 12px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);">
                  <div style="font-size: 30px; font-weight: 900; color: #ffffff; font-family: monospace;" id="cd-mins">35</div>
                  <div style="font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6ee7b7; font-weight: bold;">Minutes</div>
                </div>
                <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85); padding: 12px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.6);">
                  <div style="font-size: 30px; font-weight: 900; color: #34d399; font-family: monospace;" id="cd-secs">12</div>
                  <div style="font-size: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #fbbf24; font-weight: bold;">Seconds</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Dua & Study Encouragement -->
              <div style="background: rgba(6, 78, 59, 0.6); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.3); font-size: 11px; text-align: center; color: #d1fae5;">
                <span style="color: #fde047; font-style: italic; font-weight: bold;">"رَّبِّ زِدْنِي عِلْمًا"</span> — O my Lord, increase me in knowledge. Focus on Physics/Chemistry practicals, mathematics revision sets, and dawn prep.
