            <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #475569; margin-bottom: 24px;">Approved by Board of Governors · Payable in Ugandan Shillings (UGX)</p>

            <div style="background: #ffffff; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 32px;">
              <div style="background: #064e3b; color: #ffffff; padding: 16px 20px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px;">
                Termly Tuition & Boarding Fees Breakdown (UGX)
              </div>
              <table class="table-auto" style="font-size: 13px;">
                <tr style="background: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 800;">
                  <th>Item Description</th><th>S.1–S.4 (Day)</th><th>S.1–S.4 (Boarding)</th><th>S.5–S.6 (Day)</th><th>S.5–S.6 (Boarding)</th>
