              <div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 24px; border-radius: 16px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
                <h3 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 4px;">Dr. Faridah Nabukenya, MBChB</h3>
